Anodizing is available in a number of colors. Electroplatingis the process of plating a thin layer of other metal or alloy on the surface of certain metal or other material parts using electrolysis.
Sand Blastingis a process of cleaning and roughening the surface of the substrate by the impact of high-speed sand flow, that is, using compressed air as a power to form a high-speed jet beam to spray high-speed spray (copper ore, quartz sand, corundum, iron sand, Hainan sand) To the surface of the workpiece to be treated, the appearance or shape of the outer surface of the workpiece surface changes.
