▪ The patch or plug-in components cannot be arranged in the process side, and the entity of the patch or plug-in components cannot enter the process side or above.
▪ The conductive copper foil in the process side should be as wide as possible. The line less than 0.4mm needs to strengthen insulation and wear resistance treatment, and the line on the edge is not less than 0.8mm.
