In view of the existing problems, at the same time, reduce manufacturing cost, improve delivery time, strictly manage and use materials, the following corresponding management measures can be taken:
All raw materials from the warehouse must be checked and logged in by the material technician, and correctly placed in the material rack according to the current or future product material station table or BOM, and marked clearly. If there is any substitution or change, it shall be confirmed and informed to relevant personnel in time.
If any doubt or deficiency is found, they shall immediately reflect and urge them. After the work order is finished, the remaining materials shall be properly stored and logged in or returned to the warehouse.
During SMT patch proofing or processing, material technicians shall inspect the MIS status of each equipment at any time, and cooperate with the team leader and engineering personnel to improve. Collect and classify the bulk parts in time and submit them to IPQC for confirmation before use.
When the refueling technician is conducting the refueling operation, he must carefully check the mark of empty tray, the material and mark in the material rack, and truthfully sign in the card and fill in the refueling record form.
Materials shall be collected and packed in time in accordance with the principle of first in first out, full in and full out, first complete and then zero, so as to avoid leaving or overstocking. It is strictly forbidden to mix or abuse different materials of the same specification but different manufacturers and customers.
Operators shall place the empty tray in the special box in order during refueling, and carefully check before daily work to ensure that no materials are abandoned. If there is any defective or scrap material, the data shall be accurate and clearly marked before being submitted to relevant personnel for handling.
