IQC must carry out sampling inspection before the copper clad laminate is put into the warehouse to check whether there is scratch on the surface of the plate and the substrate is exposed. If there is, IQC should contact the supplier in time and make appropriate treatment according to the actual situation.
When cutting, the copper foil is scratched by the friction between the copper clad laminate and sharp objects to form the phenomenon of exposing the base material. Therefore, the table must be cleaned carefully before cutting to ensure that the table is smooth without hard sharp objects.
Scratch due to improper operation when stacking plates after copper deposition and whole plate electroplating:
There is no hole in the drill nozzle due to burning or dust blocking.
Pore free caused by pore forming agent: it is due to imbalance or failure of chemical concentration of pore forming agent. The function of the pore forming agent is to adjust the electrical properties of the insulating substrate on the pore wall, so as to facilitate the subsequent adsorption of palladium ions and ensure the complete coverage of chemical copper.
① If the temperature is low, the density of palladium deposition is not enough and the chemical copper coverage is not complete; When the temperature is high, the material cost will increase because of the fast reaction.
③ In the production process, the activator solution should be well maintained. If the pollution degree is serious, the palladium deposited on the pore wall will not be compact, and the subsequent chemical copper coverage will not be complete.
② When the concentration of Cu2 + is 1.5-3.0 g / L, the activity of the solution is not good and the porosity is poor; If the concentration is more than 3.5g/l, due to the rapid reaction of the solution and the rapid release of copper ions, the copper particles on the plate surface will be reworked or even scrapped. In this way, the copper precipitation solution should be filtered immediately, otherwise the solution may be scrapped.
There is no hole when the drill nozzle burns or the hole is blocked by dust a.
b. The suction of the vacuum cleaner is not big enough, or it is not done well in the engineering optimization, there is dust blockage in the hole when drilling, and there is no copper deposit when chemical copper, resulting in non porosity.
