① When the temperature is controlled between 25 ℃ and 32 ℃, the activity of the solution is not good, resulting in non porosity; If the temperature is higher than 38 ℃, it is easy to rework or even scrap the copper particles on the plate surface due to the quick reaction and release of copper ions. At this time, the copper solution should be filtered immediately, otherwise it may be scrapped.
