In order to maintain the molding of PVC pipe fittings in a suitable temperature range during mass production, a strict temperature control system should be set on the PVC pipe fitting injection molding machine, with the PVC pipe fitting mold, using a mold temperature machine and a chiller, and the injection screw barrel. A fan is installed on the top of the hopper.
Since PVC pipe fitting molds usually have a lot of core pulling actions, under the same clamping force or injection volume, compared with ordinary molds, pipe fitting molds need more space for core pulling. The special injection molding machine for PVC has an extra 200mm safety door distance on each side.
