Attention should also be paid to the amounts of fat ingested due to a possible change in the lipid status of the blood, as well as the triglycerides. So also with the consumption of proteins by the kidney function and the glucose rate by the low consumption of carbohydrates.
That's why it's always recommended to look for a professional nutritionist to help you in the elaboration of a safe and healthy diet.
