Practicing high bar: Selecting a high branch or establishing a high bar (like horizontal bar). Practicing pulling up and down five to seven times everyday.
Punching and kicking: Using two hands to punch a bag of grains everyday. If practicing for a long time, one could punch through a banana tree.
