Do not operate any switch knob with wet hands to avoid electric shock.
The dust accumulated in the workshop should be cleaned up in time. Smoking and other types of fire are prohibited in the workshop to prevent dust explosion.
Do not check or replace electrical components with electricity, otherwise it may cause electric shock or injury.
