Ottawa, ON – FileCatalyst, an Emmy® award-winning pioneer in managed file transfers and a world leading accelerated file transfer solution, has announced that their technology has been integrated with LiveU DataBridge to provide multi-gigabit transfer speeds. LiveU DataBridge allows broadcasters and field crews to enjoy the highest bandwidth and availability for wireless broadband on-the-go.
“We have always wanted to find an ISV partnership that helps us overcome the challenges of sending large media files across the WAN. FileCatalyst has not only provided that solution, but also provides the speed, security, and reliability they are known for,” said Haim Rapoport, VP Product for LiveU.
Located in Ottawa, Canada, FileCatalyst is a pioneer in managed file transfers and an Emmy® award-winning leader of accelerated file transfer solutions. The company, founded in 2000, has more than one thousand customers in media & entertainment, energy & mining, gaming, printing, military, and government including many Fortune 500 companies.
